	(descr "Power Integrations InSOP-24D (InnoSwitch3-AQ INN399xCQ). Manufacturer PCB pad layout POD-inSOP-24D Rev C (datasheet p.30): secondary row 12 pads 0.41x1.58 mm at 0.75 mm pitch (pins 1-12); primary row 12.72 mm center-to-center from secondary: D=24 opposite pin 1, wide source pad 1.58x2.81 mm centered 4.80 mm from pad 24 - drawn as pad 16 with pads 17/18/19 stacked on the same copper at the physical lead positions to match the INN3990CQ symbol pins 16-19 (all same net); NC=15 at 6.75, BPP=14 at 7.50, V=13 at 8.25 mm. IMPORTANT board-level rule: keep the 11.14 mm primary-to-secondary gap zone copper-free on all layers (reinforced isolation) - add a board rule area, KiCad footprints cannot carry it.")
